sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User (Discord DM)
    participant D as Discord
    participant B as Discord Adapter
    participant C as A2A Client Core
    participant A as Remote Agent (A2A v1.0)

    U->>D: DM: "https://agent.example.com"
    D->>B: MESSAGE_CREATE (DM — no privileged intent)
    B->>C: addContact(url)
    C->>A: GET /.well-known/agent-card.json
    A-->>C: Agent Card (skills, bindings, auth)
    C-->>B: Contact added
    B->>D: reply with card summary
    D-->>U: sees Contact

    U->>D: DM: "Summarize this repo's issues"
    D->>B: MESSAGE_CREATE
    B->>C: message(Contact, text)
    C->>A: SendStreamingMessage (Conversation's contextId)
    A-->>C: SSE: task (TASK_STATE_SUBMITTED)
    loop batched (~1 edit / 1-2s, header-driven backoff)
        A-->>C: SSE: statusUpdate / artifactUpdate
        C-->>B: partial text
        B->>D: edit reply message
        D-->>U: watches progress
    end
    A-->>C: SSE: statusUpdate (TASK_STATE_COMPLETED), stream closes
    C-->>B: final text
    B->>D: final edit
    D-->>U: answer

    Note over C,A: Non-streaming fallback: SendMessage (returnImmediately: true) + GetTask polling
    Note over B,C: Restart recovery: SubscribeToTask re-attaches to in-flight tasks (soft state)
